This is Slimez-TD a tower defense game made in godot theres not much to say about the game.
Nothing happens when you complete the game and there isnt much content
Keep in mind this game is a work in progress there will be more content and features addded later on in the development
A lot of the assets in this game are placeholders and will be replaced eventually

How To Play:
1. Find the game on Itch.io with [this link](https://burnt-cookie.itch.io/slimez-td)
2. Play the Game with one of two choices:
  - Use the built in web player
  - Download the windows build of the game and run the "Slimez-TD" executable
